[00:01.45]Model Test 19
[00:04.35]Section A  
[00:06.45]Directions: In this section, you will hear two long conversations.
[00:11.72]At the end of each conversation, you will hear four questions.
[00:16.09]Both the conversation and the questions will be spoken only once.
